{
    "title": "Backpacker\u2122 Travel Quiz Trivia",
    "description": "Backpacker is the ultimate mix of a travel game and a quiz game that lets you traverse the globe, while testing your wits with trivia questions. Feel the thrill of discovering new cities and landmarks, answering challenging trivia questions, and collecting unique souvenirs in a quiz game format that will keep you engaged and entertained for hours on end.\r\n\r\nVisit cities all over the world! Start your journey and visit many iconic cities, such as London, Paris, Tokyo, or New York City. Progress through the travel game and unlock even more new cities and more landmarks to visit, each with its own souvenirs.\r\n\r\nAnswer trivia questions to unlock the landmarks of the city and buy amazing souvenirs: Each city presents its set of trivia questions to answer and jobs to complete. Correctly answer questions to unlock new landmarks and souvenirs. The more questions you answer correctly, the faster you'll progress through the quiz game.\r\n\r\nCollect souvenirs from the cities: As you visit different the landmarks of the cities be sure to collect souvenirs as tokens of your virtual travels. All the souvenirs are unique to the city you visit, so be sure to collect them all!\r\n\r\nCan you answer all the trivia questions? Can you collect all the souvenirs? Backpacker is the perfect mix of a quiz game and a travel game for anyone who loves travel, trivia, and quiz games!\r\n\r\nStay connected with Backpacker\r\nWebsite: https://www.qiiwi.com/backpacker/     \r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/BackpackerGame",
    "descriptionHTML": "Backpacker is the ultimate mix of a travel game and a quiz game that lets you traverse the globe, while testing your wits with trivia questions. Feel the thrill of discovering new cities and landmarks, answering challenging trivia questions, and collecting unique souvenirs in a quiz game format that will keep you engaged and entertained for hours on end.<br><br>Visit cities all over the world! Start your journey and visit many iconic cities, such as London, Paris, Tokyo, or New York City. Progress through the travel game and unlock even more new cities and more landmarks to visit, each with its own souvenirs.<br><br>Answer trivia questions to unlock the landmarks of the city and buy amazing souvenirs: Each city presents its set of trivia questions to answer and jobs to complete. Correctly answer questions to unlock new landmarks and souvenirs. The more questions you answer correctly, the faster you&#39;ll progress through the quiz game.<br><br>Collect souvenirs from the cities: As you visit different the landmarks of the cities be sure to collect souvenirs as tokens of your virtual travels. All the souvenirs are unique to the city you visit, so be sure to collect them all!<br><br>Can you answer all the trivia questions? Can you collect all the souvenirs? Backpacker is the perfect mix of a quiz game and a travel game for anyone who loves travel, trivia, and quiz games!<br><br>Stay connected with Backpacker<br>Website: https://www.qiiwi.com/backpacker/     <br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/BackpackerGame",
